OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to unveil plans to offer
OL,4,Ctechnical subjects to 14-year-olds
OL,6,FNew technical education routes will be
OL,7,Favailable to 14-year-olds under plans
OL,8,Funveiled by Andy Burnham to tackle
OL,9,Frising youth unemployment.
OL,11,FThe prime minister said he was on "a
OL,12,Fmission" to curb the rise of young
OL,13,Fpeople not in education, employment or
OL,14,Ftraining (Neet), which now stands at
OL,15,Fmore than one million.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31002
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to unveil plans to offer
OL,4,Ctechnical subjects to 14-year-olds
OL,6,FBurham's proposals to shake up the
OL,7,Feducation system were aimed at
OL,8,Fpreventing the rising trend rather
OL,9,Fthan tackling the current figure, but
OL,10,Fhe did not set a date for getting the
OL,11,FNeet numbers falling.
OL,13,FHe told reporters during a Tuesday
OL,14,Fvisit to Derby: "I will commit, in my
OL,15,Ftime in office, to get the number of
OL,16,Fyoung people who are not in education,
OL,17,Femployment, and training down. I will
OL,18,Fcommit to that.
OL,20,F"When precisely I can get there will
OL,21,Fis a hard thing to say right now."
OL,26,@vD@QOU|D@AOU}D@bO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31003
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to unveil plans to offer
OL,4,Ctechnical subjects to 14-year-olds
OL,6,FUnder the plans, from Year 10, pupils
OL,7,Fwill be able to combine core academic
OL,8,Fsubjects, such as English and maths,
OL,9,Fwith technical education linked to
OL,10,Fjobs available in their area.
OL,12,FThe new technical pathways, set to be
OL,13,Frolled out in September 2028, will
OL,14,Fpair skills training with work
OL,15,Fexperience and connections with local
OL,16,Femployers.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31004
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to unveil plans to offer
OL,4,Ctechnical subjects to 14-year-olds
OL,6,FHe said: "We've had a system built for
OL,7,Ftoo long around the university route
OL,8,Fand it sends a message to some young
OL,9,Fpeople that they're some kind of
OL,10,Fsecond-class citizens and it's just
OL,11,Fnot right.
OL,13,F"They need an education system that
OL,14,Fworks for them, that offers a path to
OL,15,Fall young people that's balanced
OL,16,Fbetween academic and technical."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31005
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to unveil plans to offer
OL,4,Ctechnical subjects to 14-year-olds
OL,6,FHe said that young people are "let
OL,7,Fdown" by the current system and
OL,8,Fpromised that "from today, Britain
OL,9,Fwill value the hard hat every bit as
OL,10,Fmuch as the graduation cap."
OL,12,FThe prime minister added the new plan
OL,13,Fwould help young people find "quality,
OL,14,Fwell-paid jobs where they live".
OL,16,FBurnham said: "Fixing the youth
OL,17,Funemployment crisis in Britain will
OL,18,Frequire a shake-up in how we do things
OL,19,F` and that's what this government will
OL,20,Fdo.
OL,26,@xD@OOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31006
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to unveil plans to offer
OL,4,Ctechnical subjects to 14-year-olds
OL,6,F"I want to ensure that our education
OL,7,Fsystem leaves no dead ends for our
OL,8,Fyoung people."
OL,10,FOfsted will also change the way they
OL,11,Finspect schools and measure
OL,12,Fperformance, ensuring they recognise
OL,13,Fschools that provide high-quality
OL,14,Ftechnical education and support young
OL,15,Fpeople to develop the skills,
OL,16,Fexperience and confidence employers
OL,17,Fare seeking.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31007
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to unveil plans to offer
OL,4,Ctechnical subjects to 14-year-olds
OL,6,FThe plans build on his devolution
OL,7,Fpolicy, bringing in regional mayors,
OL,8,Flocal leaders, schools, colleges and
OL,9,Femployers to create the new technical
OL,10,Fpathways, which can be tailored around
OL,11,Flocal industries and growth sectors.
OL,13,FThese could include advanced
OL,14,Fmanufacturing, AI, digital and
OL,15,Ftechnology, clean energy, life
OL,16,Fsciences, construction, healthcare or
OL,17,Fthe creative industries, depending on
OL,18,Flocal strengths.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31008
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to unveil plans to offer
OL,4,Ctechnical subjects to 14-year-olds
OL,6,FThere are currently no clear details
OL,7,Fabout how the scheme would work in
OL,8,Fareas of low industrial activity where
OL,9,Fthe options for jobs and technical
OL,10,Feducation may be more limited.
OL,12,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/15
