FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31009
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to unveil plans to offer
OL,4,Ctechnical subjects to 14-year-olds
OL,6,FBurnham introduced the Greater
OL,7,FManchester Baccalaureate (MBacc)
OL,8,Fduring his time as mayor, which is
OL,9,Faimed at offering a technical
OL,10,Feducation alternative to the academic
OL,11,FEnglish Baccalaureate (EBacc).
OL,13,FEducation Secretary Lucy Powell said:
OL,14,F"By offering high-quality technical
OL,15,Fand vocational education alongside
OL,16,Facademic achievement, we'll give more
OL,17,Fyoung people the chance to leave
OL,18,Feducation with the skills, confidence
OL,19,Fand opportunities they need to thrive
OL,20,Fin today's economy and the careers of
OL,21,Fthe future."
OL,26,@vD@AOU}D@LO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31010
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to unveil plans to offer
OL,4,Ctechnical subjects to 14-year-olds
OL,6,FThe changes follow Alan Milburn's
OL,7,Fwarning in his May report that Britain
OL,8,Frisked leaving behind a "lost
OL,9,Fgeneration" of young people ill-
OL,10,Fprepared for work.
OL,12,FMilburn welcomed the plans, adding:
OL,13,F"They are a big step in the right
OL,14,Fdirection and consistent with the
OL,15,Ffindings of my review."
OL,26,@pD@YOUqD@KO]uD@AOUwD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31011
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to unveil plans to offer
OL,4,Ctechnical subjects to 14-year-olds
OL,6,FHowever, shadow education secretary
OL,7,FLaura Trott criticised the policy and
OL,8,Fsaid: "The announcements today don't
OL,9,Fcome anywhere close to undoing the
OL,10,Fdamage Labour has already done to the
OL,11,Fjob market."
OL,13,FShe said that the current Labour
OL,14,Fpolicy, including the increase to
OL,15,Fminimum wage, was driving the high
OL,16,Fnumber of youth unemployment.
OL,18,FShe said: "They are making it too
OL,19,Fexpensive to hire young people, and
OL,20,Fdestroying jobs with their jobs tax
OL,21,Fand employer red tape."
OL,26,@pD@GOUzD@KOU}D@WO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31012
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to unveil plans to offer
OL,4,Ctechnical subjects to 14-year-olds
OL,6,FLiberal Democrat education
OL,7,Fspokesperson Munira Wilson said the
OL,8,Fplan "must come in with built-in
OL,9,Fsafeguards to allow young people the
OL,10,Fflexibility to retrospectively change
OL,11,Fdirection and move between 'academic'
OL,12,Fand 'technical'".
OL,14,FShe added: "We must not allow these
OL,15,Fchanges to predetermine children's
OL,16,Ffutures at just 14, baking in
OL,17,Fdisadvantage."
OL,26,@pD@FOUtD@PO]vD@LOUyD@NO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31013
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to unveil plans to offer
OL,4,Ctechnical subjects to 14-year-olds
OL,6,FGeneral Secretary of the NAHT school
OL,7,Fleaders union Paul Whiteman called for
OL,8,Fgreater clarity on the plans and said:
OL,9,F"We welcome the ambition to strengthen
OL,10,Ftechnical and vocational education...
OL,12,F"However, this announcement sets out a
OL,13,Fdirection of travel rather than
OL,14,Fdetailed proposals, and schools will
OL,15,Fneed much greater clarity about what
OL,16,Fit means in practice and over funding."
OL,26,@qD@AOUtD@AOUxD@gO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31014
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to unveil plans to offer
OL,4,Ctechnical subjects to 14-year-olds
OL,6,FGeneral Secretary of the Association
OL,7,Fof School and College Leaders Pepe
OL,8,FDi'Iasio said they are pleased the
OL,9,FGovernment is treating this as an
OL,10,F"urgent priority", but the timing of
OL,11,Fthe announcement is "unfortunate".
OL,13,FHe said: "To make major educational
OL,14,Fpolicy announcements in the middle of
OL,15,Fthe summer holiday is wrong,
OL,16,Fparticularly when there is so little
OL,17,Fdetail."
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@QO]sD@UOUsD@aO]uD@JOUyD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
