FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31015
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785286071
OL,3,CBurnham to unveil plans to offer
OL,4,Ctechnical subjects to 14-year-olds
OL,6,FConnie Muttock, head of policy at the
OL,7,FCentre for Young Lives think tank,
OL,8,Fsaid: "This announcement is an
OL,9,Fimportant leap forward towards
OL,10,Frebuilding a high-achieving, high
OL,11,Faspirations, high-quality education
OL,12,Fsystem that works for all children,
OL,13,Fwherever they grow up."
